sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    %% PATHWAY.ECO — Workflow 3: Mentor Application, Admin Approval & Account Activation
    
    actor Applicant as Mentor Applicant (:3000)
    actor Admin as Platform Admin (:3003)
    actor Mentor as Activated Mentor (:3001)
    participant MW as Edge Middleware
    participant Service as MentorApplicationService
    participant TokenService as PasswordSetupTokenService
    participant DB as Prisma / MongoDB
    participant Zepto as ZeptoMail API

    Applicant->>MW: POST /api/mentor-applications (Public form)
    MW->>Service: MentorApplicationSubmissionSchema.parse(payload)
    Service->>Service: Generate human-readable referenceId (PM-2026-XXXXX)
    Service->>DB: db.mentorApplication.create({ status: 'PENDING', referenceId, ... })
    DB-->>Service: Application staged (No User created yet)
    Service-)Zepto: Non-blocking sendMentorApplicationReceivedEmail()
    Service-->>Applicant: HTTP 201 Created { referenceId, status: 'PENDING' }

    Admin->>MW: POST /api/admin/mentors/applications/:id/status (Cookie: pathway_admin_session)
    MW->>Service: Verify Admin session & role == 'ADMIN'
    Service->>DB: Check if applicant already exists in db.user
    alt User Exists (Candidate Account)
        Service->>DB: Safely elevate user: role = 'MENTOR' (Preserve candidate history)
    else New Applicant
        Service->>DB: db.user.create({ role: 'MENTOR', mustChangePassword: true })
    end
    Service->>DB: db.mentor.upsert({ status: 'APPROVED', publicProfileEnabled: true })
    Service->>DB: db.mentorApplication.update({ status: 'APPROVED', reviewedBy: admin.name })
    
    Service->>TokenService: createSetupToken(userId)
    TokenService->>TokenService: crypto.randomBytes(32).toString('hex')
    TokenService->>DB: Invalidate prior tokens (usedAt = now)
    TokenService->>DB: db.passwordSetupToken.create({ tokenHash = sha256(rawToken), expiresAt: now + 24h })
    Service-)Zepto: sendMentorApplicationApprovedEmail({ setupUrl: /setup-password?token=rawToken })
    Service-->>Admin: HTTP 200 OK (Application approved, mentor record created)

    Mentor->>MW: POST /api/auth/setup-password { token: rawToken, password: newPassword }
    MW->>TokenService: consumeSetupToken(rawToken, newPassword)
    TokenService->>DB: Verify sha256(rawToken) match & not expired & not used
    TokenService->>DB: Update user: passwordHash = bcrypt(newPassword, 12), mustChangePassword = false
    TokenService->>DB: Mark token.usedAt = now (Single-use consumed)
    TokenService->>DB: AuditLog MENTOR_PASSWORD_SETUP_COMPLETED
    TokenService-->>Mentor: HTTP 200 OK (Issued active career_mentor_session)
    Note over Mentor, DB: Mentor profile is now active on public marketplace for candidate bookings
